 "footnotes": [
  {
   "id": "c-fig-9-3-cited",
   "kind": "correction",
   "html": "原书引用了图 (9.3)，并且没有闭合括号。所指的图是图 7.1。"
  },
  {
   "id": "c-omega-over-delta",
   "kind": "correction",
   "html": "从接近$-\\infty$变到接近$\\infty$的比值是$\\kDelta/\\kOmega$。当$\\kDelta$扫过共振时，$\\kOmega/\\kDelta$从接近0经过$\\pm\\infty$再回到接近0，而$\\tan 2\\ktheta = -2\\kOmega/\\kDelta$使混合角转过$\\pi/2$。"
  },
  {
   "id": "c-eq-7-21",
   "kind": "correction",
   "html": "按原书印出的形式，$\\epsilon$具有作用量倒数的量纲。式 (7.19) 与1比较的无量纲比值是$\\epsilon = \\hbar\\dot{\\ktheta}/|\\kepsp - \\kepsm|$。"
  },
  {
   "id": "c-theta-dot",
   "kind": "correction",
   "html": "取$\\kDelta = \\kalpha\\kt$和$\\kOmega = \\kOmega_0$，式 (7.16) 给出$\\dot{\\ktheta} = \\kalpha\\kOmega_0/(\\kalpha^2\\kt^2 + 4\\kOmega_0^2)$，它在共振处为$\\kalpha/4\\kOmega_0$，而不是$\\kalpha/2\\kOmega_0$。在分裂为$2\\hbar\\kOmega_0$时，小参数为$\\epsilon \\approx \\kalpha/8\\kOmega_0^2$。"
  },
  {
   "id": "c-eq-7-23",
   "kind": "correction",
   "html": "$\\kPLZ - 1$为负。由式 (7.22)，非绝热修正恰好是$1 - \\kPLZ = e^{-2\\pi|\\kOmega_0|^2/|\\kalpha|}$。用$\\epsilon$表示，取原书的$\\epsilon \\approx \\kalpha/4\\kOmega_0^2$时它是$e^{-\\pi/2\\epsilon}$，取$\\epsilon \\approx \\kalpha/8\\kOmega_0^2$时是$e^{-\\pi/4\\epsilon}$。"
  },
  {
   "id": "c-fig-7-1",
   "kind": "correction",
   "html": "在原书的“绝热通道”分图中，从1出发的曲线标为$P_2$，上升到1的曲线标为$P_1$。对于图注和正文所描述的从$|1\\rangle$到$|2\\rangle$的转移，下降的曲线是$\\kPone$，上升的曲线是$\\kPtwo$，正如“绝热返回”分图的颜色所示。",
   "figure": "sim-adiabatic"
  }
 ],
